## PRD: LocalStorage Persistence with TTL

### What Is
Basket store does not persist to localStorage, causing cart data loss on page refresh.

### What Should Be
Basket persists to localStorage with 30-day TTL to prevent ghost carts from stale data.

### Definition of Done

[ ] Add localStorage persistence to zustand store
[ ] Add savedAt timestamp to state shape
[ ] Add onRehydrateStorage with TTL check (1 day)
[ ] Add _hasHydrated guard to useStore
[ ] Unit test: persists only {productId, quantity, savedAt}
[ ] Unit test: clears cart after 30 days

### Verification

```bash
npm run test:unit
```
